The lastfilled is -100.
For every spot from 0 to last.
If item spot of seats is 1, set lastfilled to spot.
Set item spot of nearest to spot minus lastfilled.

Set lastfilled to 100.
The spot is last.
Repeat while spot is at least 0.
If item spot of seats is 1, set lastfilled to spot.
